note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note om/gpu/engine/runtime_qwen4.om: Pure Seeded-OM-2 Zero-CUDA Runtime for Qwen 3.8 Flash Next (qwen4_exp).
note Implements:
note   - 4-stream Gated Residual Hyper-Connections (attn_hyper_connection, mlp_hyper_connection, hyper_connection_mixer)
note   - 51B N-gram Per-Layer Embedding (PLE) streamed sparsely from NVMe (16 rows x 160 B = 2.56 KB/tok, 0 GPU RAM)
note   - 48-layer Hybrid GDN (sigmoid output gate) + Full Attention (24Q/2KV, hd=256, rope=64)
note   - 512-expert Top-10 MoE (W4 block-32 quantized on GPU from FP8 block-128) + Gated Shared Expert
note   - Single-submit pre-recorded GPFIFO execution of all 48 layers + hyper_connection_mixer + Two-Pass lm_head!

note Qwen4Exp dedicated workspace slots inside engWork (28 MB .. 32 MB, disjoint from EW_PKT 4..24 MB)
